<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Equity Marketing a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Equity Marketing a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Jefferies &amp; Co analyst Gary Jacobson said he upgraded his recommendation on Equity Marketing Inc to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>--other details were unavailable.</p>
<p>--shares of Equity Marketing were 1-3/8 higher at 18-1/4 in morning trading on Nasdaq.</p>
